<!-- G11a-2 fixture, written by hand for the parity harness of PPP (no source music): notes that are tied TO but nothing leads into, for follow mode. Bar 1: an RH E5 that stops a tie nobody started, on beat 3, while the LH holds a half note. Bar 2 (repeated with bars 1-2): the LH has a G2 that stops a tie nobody started on beat 2 while the RH rests for the whole bar (a rest gate that the onset falls into). Bar 3: both hands tie a note over to bar 4 correctly (led into, not struck twice). Written order: 1 2 | 1 2 3 4. -->
